<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:26.270
<i>I battled against and critically damaged the WaDom...</i>

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:28.060
<i>...and the other Mobile Suits.</i>

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:33.650
<i>However, The couple that we came across in the dried river valley...</i>

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:36.690
<i>...got me involved in the excavation of a spaceship.</i>

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:42.860
<i>And so I didn't even notice Lady Kihel's unusual behavior.</i>

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:52.040
<b>Separated Again</b>

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:06.550
Alright, that's good! This weapon is fairly useful!

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:22.580
This must be a spacecraft.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:24.950
Do you think it can operate?

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.080
l really wouldn't know.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.160
Loran, wouldn't you know better than any of us?

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.380
If I consider how much taller this tree has grown, it must near here.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:56.820
Just as I thought...

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.610
l was correct.

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.160
Sir Will Game...

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.280
No task is too difficult for you, is it?

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:07.570
It's Miss Dianna's power that I borrow which makes it so.

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:14.750
It's better to leave this thing behind...

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.080
Without him, this house from Albany is...

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:19.260
I'm very sorry!

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:22.760
- I'm didn't mean...
- You know, climbing trees is rather dangerous, Ma'am.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.550
Right!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.970
What were you looking at there?

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.850
I wanted to take a look at the nest.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.270
Nests are very common on the Earth, aren't they?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:36.480
Every nest is a little different from one place to another, so it's worth searching for rare specimens.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:41.190
That's right, nothing in this world is the same.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.690
Yes, that's right, Ms. Teteth Halleh.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.380
- This here is...
- Do you understand it?

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.160
I'm not entirely sure, but...

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:29.990
If this is the desk I used...

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.860
It's a picture... of us.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:43.170
Ms. Teteth!

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.470
Hey, The dream is now no longer a dream!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:50.260
Oh? That's great news!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.180
We should go and contact the Militia before too much time passes.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:56.480
Mr. Will, you wouldn't happen to have a telephone?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.480
We sold things like that long ago,

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.070
The neighbor to the west probably has one.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.150
- Neighbor?
- About ten Kilometers from here.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.060
Welcome back!

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.280
Miss Kihel Heim, Guess what?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.370
Today's harvest proved bountiful!

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.580
That's good news.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.580
That spacecraft still operates.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.960
Tonight, we had better celebrate!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.660
That sounds great!

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.970
Are you feeling tired, Milady Kihel?

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:31.760
There was even an old derelict spacecraft near Albany...

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.190
It must have been there back then as well.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.190
That means...

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:40.230
There was no need for me to rush back to the Moon so soon.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:46.690
I was being careless. I wasn't thinking...

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:54.200
Are you okay, Milady Kihel?

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.360
Are you feeling dizzy after being on your feet for so long?

00:05:57.720 --> 00:06:01.170
As if born from the evening sky itself, the moon has risen.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.460
It's an incredible sight for me to behold.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.370
You're quite poetic, Milady Kihel.

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:10.930
Why do we have to follow your command!?

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:15.680
Does being under the command of the Luzianna Militia dissatisfy you?

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.060
Of course it does!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:21.480
The Inglessa Militia is still capable of fighting on its own!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.070
But given Inglessa's circumstances...

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.280
...you'd struggle to get reinforcements in a pinch, correct?

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:30.950
However, the only force here that has mechanical dolls is Inglessa!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.160
Without our mechanical dolls...

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.660
...there would be no way for us to fight against the Dianna Counter.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:39.160
- Oh, are you sure about that?
- Is that the enemy?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:42.380
- Joseph?
- Wait...

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:47.460
There's no need for distress.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:51.300
Allow me to introduce Territory of Luzianna's Specialized Suicide Squadron.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.970
Suicide Squadron?

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.850
Is that the name of their Mechanized forces?

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.770
Suicide Squad?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.390
That's right.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:04.190
Mechanical Dolls!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.770
This is Luzianna's...!?

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.810
Those aren't Dianna Counter's mechanical dolls?

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.360
In our land...

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.990
...we have found these mechanical dolls!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:16.580
We call them the Borjarnon.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.080
We expect to uncover many more.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.160
Utilizing these...

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:23.080
We can fight on an equal level against Dianna Counter!

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.170
A Mountain Cycle...

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.870
...outside of Inglessa's?

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:30.050
My name is Gavane Gooney, Joseph Yaht.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:32.050
I service our machinery.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:33.970
Nice to meet you, Miss Sochie Heim.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.760
You know me?

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.810
You're the infamous brave female Kapool Pilot.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.520
Oh, that's right. Nice to meet you.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.980
Will there be any problems with digging out that spacecraft?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.270
There shouldn't be.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.730
Still, don't you think doing that could escalate the war?

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.860
Isn't that a problem?

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.490
It may cause the war to intensify...

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:56.410
...or it may help people.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.290
We don't need to worry about things like that right now.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.950
I suppose that's true.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.960
Guin will probably know what to do.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.670
The phone lines seem to be down for now.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.250
We'll report it to the Militia first thing in the morning.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.790
Sure.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.760
Is that you?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.680
I have something to show you.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.180
An image plate?

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.560
Do you know who it is?

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.270
That looks like the Will from a few generations before me.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:30.570
The people from the moon want to live on earth.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.280
Why do you want to go to the moon?

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.070
I wanted to prove the legend of my ancestor's romance.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:39.200
I'll do whatever it takes to meet that goal.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.570
The Romance...

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:45.750
The declaration of a new fiefdom?

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.880
Yes.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:50.880
It will also decide what Dianna Counter's territory should be.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.010
We've wasted too much time! In that case...

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.470
No, we should decide on our territory.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.890
After doing that...

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:01.470
We'll be the ones with justice on our side to stand in the way of those who attack us.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.940
In our current state, we are the invaders.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.980
Ambassador Miran!

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.270
This war needs a just cause!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:12.570
After the declaration's made, what'll happen to the negotiations?

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.780
The negotiations must become beneficial to our side.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:20.240
So you're saying that it'll convince Lord Rhineford to concede a more balanced agreement with us?

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.370
- But!
- That's correct.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.960
With him as our negotiator, that'd be the best approach for us to take.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:28.380
Yes, I'll begin the preparations at once.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:31.670
During that time period, we must try our best to avoid fighting.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.090
Right.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.970
May l come in?

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.680
With... Me like this?

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.180
It's no big deal.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.180
Say...About the spacecraft...

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.680
Even if you dig it out, will you be able to go to the moon?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.350
What... do you mean?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.060
After the Militia has excavated it,

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:48.850
It can also be used for the sake of waging war.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:52.360
You're saying they'd be thinking about using our spacecraft for fighting?

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.860
There is a war going on now, you know...

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.780
So what should I do?

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.280
You should take your discovery to Dianna Counter.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:02.160
Do you mean those people coming from the moon?

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.160
The people from the moon...

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.790
...will immediately know how to operate that ship.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.580
- You're right.
- So, In that case...

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.880
You...Who are you?

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:12.710
Why do you want me do this?

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.380
I just want to help you realize your dream.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:19.970
You've worked hard for years all for the sake of going to the moon.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.590
Yeah.

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.680
Those soldiers from the Militia...

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.970
...have no intention of ever reaching the moon.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.560
That... That's true.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.850
We can't just contact Dianna Counter on our own from here.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.770
Bring them that Mechanical Doll you found...

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.650
Then they will listen to you.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.070
I'm not sure if I can operate it myself.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.610
Could... you possibly teach me?

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:05.640
I could take Will back to the moon myself...

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:11.640
However...My wish was to live together with that man.

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:15.930
Have Loran and his friends woken up?

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.620
Good morning.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.620
Forgive me for waking you up so early.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.910
Did you start up the White Doll?

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.960
No, that noise woke me up as well.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.830
Mr. Will Game!

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.630
Are you leaving?

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.010
I've found a way to get to the moon.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.340
Way of getting to the moon? Where are you going?

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:43.640
l will join Dianna Counter.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.300
Dianna Counter?

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.310
Doesn't that Sid belong to the Militia?

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:50.520
I think I'd have a better chance of reaching the moon if I helped the other faction.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.100
Then, has that thing come to pick you up?

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.730
Not at all.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:57.230
It was excavated from the same tunnel as the Spacecraft.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:59.530
Mr. Will, please hold on.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:03.530
Your desires are different from mine. Don't get in the way of my own dream.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:07.610
I'm simply a man who wishes to accomplish the first Will's unfulfilled dream.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.540
It's a mechanical doll!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.910
It's not from Dianna Counter.

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:21.410
It's time to go, dear.

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:23.510
I will be back someday.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.930
You can stay here until then, if you'd like.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.930
Will...

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.630
Did he mention Dianna Counter?

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:34.190
Boy, would you like to come with us as well?

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.570
Ms. Teteth!?

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:40.440
You could sell your Mobile suit for a good price.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:48.910
You can go ahead and excavate the spacecraft from the valley.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.040
That man excavated that mechanical doll...

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.330
...and he didn't even bother to tell us about it.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.630
Loran, that woman's actually from the Moonrace, isn't she?

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.290
Really? You think so?

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.710
But that mobile suit's in excellent shape.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.550
With the User's Manual, anyone should be able to use it.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.060
That woman...

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.930
Loran, stop them.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:13.930
Life will get tough if Dianna Counter learns about that spacecraft.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.800
Right.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:21.310
ls Will Game's family always like this?

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:27.730
No matter what I wished for, Will leaves for his own adventure.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:42.700
I just can't feel satisfied with this...

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:51.140
I never ordered you to take point.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.720
Your group should follow us from behind.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.510
You're pretty arrogant for a man without any real combat experience!

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.600
Commander, we'd be better off...

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.610
...without having Inglessa's useless balls on our team.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.400
Discipline is the most important factor in the battlefield.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:08.070
We have to show those children just what we can do.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:16.400
You can't second guess a mechanical doll's abilities by appearance alone.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.630
If Will wants to reach Dianna Counter...

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:30.210
If he contacts Dianna Counter...

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:34.130
...His life won't end up the way he expects.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.230
If we can't jump over that valley...

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:43.150
Then it will take us two or three more days, Ms. Teteth.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.320
This mechanical doll is very old.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.740
If we could just use the hover jump...

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.600
...then it would be very easy.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.240
This piece of...

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:56.120
What will that boy do once he's caught up with us?

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.910
Ms. Teteth, please turn the mechanical doll around.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:58.660
Alright!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.000
Don't get in the way of my life.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.880
You are free to continue excavating the spacecraft if you wish...

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.130
But l don't want to be the one who hands it to the Militia...

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.380
...only to let them use it as a tool for war.

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:09.300
Lady Teteth!

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.430
Do you want to join the Dianna Counter as well?

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.930
I only follow Will.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:17.140
Women like men who follow their dreams.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:18.600
Mr. Will Game!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.300
Please don't appease Dianna Counter!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.610
It's none of your business, foreigners!

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:29.310
If you try and stop us again, l will use this cannon.

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:34.910
Are those Mobile Suits?

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.320
- Will, get behind my seat.
- Yeah.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.420
Is that the resistance army!?

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.840
l come for the Mustached Gundam, but I meet them instead.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.910
Whose army is that?

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:54.300
Don't panic. If we respond like we did during training...

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.920
Those mechanical dolls won't prove the least bit intimidating.

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:03.360
Strange, l have not seen this method of attack.

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:05.220
Is that some kind of explosive?

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:13.110
Our only choice is to trade this thing to Dianna Counter's forces.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:15.530
We... we have to fight?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:18.030
You'll do anything for the sake of getting to the moon, won't you?

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.040
Yes...

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.410
Did they construct these units from the Mustached Suit's design?

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:37.550
This... Is this the power of their mechanical dolls?

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:42.510
Are you fighting for Dianna Counter?

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:46.930
My name is Will Game.

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:51.810
White Doll!?

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:00.040
Mr. Will, you can hear me, right?

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.040
If you join Dianna Counter...

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.620
If you give them that mechanical doll...

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:07.210
...you will only be used as a part of their army!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:11.130
Their goal is to stay on earth!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.510
They have no intention of returning to the moon!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.640
Dianna Counter isn't going back to the moon?

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.720
They need to resupply eventually.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.720
Furthermore, would anyone completely abandon their homeland?

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:25.360
Is that young man using Laura's White Doll?

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:28.640
You suddenly appear, talking like some big shot...

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:35.740
These mobile suits fighting with the Kapools...

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.410
Whose Militia is this?

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.730
Is Harry's SUMO the only one here?

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:43.910
Will!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.830
He seems to have made contact...

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.620
...with the Mobile Suits from the Dianna Counter.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.420
You'll fall, Milady!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.210
We have to go down to the bottom of valley and stop him.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:55.300
You must be joking! How are we supposed to get down there?

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.130
We have to try!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.010
l cannot let that one innocent man...

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.510
...become involved in this war!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.840
Please, you have to stop!

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.020
Milady, please stop! It's far too dangerous!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:13.430
I have to try, I have to succeed!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.410
The fingers won't work...

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.240
But I can grab the whole thing!

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:34.500
We have to do whatever we can to cover the White Doll!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:39.300
Lieutenant Harry always wanted to see this suit's true fighting capabilities.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.930
After all, he belongs to the Royal Guard.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.220
All of those suits must be relics like the White Doll...

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:48.130
Unfortunately, it looks like Laura's not the pilot this time.

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.010
Watch this!

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:07.370
The mustached White Doll...!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.610
Loran's fighting with him?

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:25.840
Am I going to lose?

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.950
Loran, where's your courage!? Stand up!

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:33.100
Stand up! White Doll!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:35.220
Didn't you once have the legendary name, "Gundam"!?

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:44.240
Am I going to die!?

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.700
It's a pity that you're not Laura Rola.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:49.450
But in order to avoid any trouble later on...

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.620
What!?

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:53.410
l cannot allow you to do whatever you want!

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:58.410
A mere flesh and blood human is willing to fight against a Mobile Suit!?

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:03.500
I've been shot!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.020
- What are you doing!
- Will!

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:12.010
I get rid of anyone that gets in my way!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.440
Now even she's...

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.320
You would use a mechanical doll...

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:20.110
...for this sort of thing?

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.690
Lady, please stop!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:25.030
l have to realize my dream of going to the moon!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.830
I won't just sit back and watch my dreams pass me by, girl.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:30.540
Even when your ancestor had his ambitious dreams...

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.910
...he ideas were still practical and well thought out!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:36.750
His actions weren't nearly as foolish as your own!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:40.920
Does she really need to take a fairy tale at face value?

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:43.120
Get out of the way, I will fire!

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:45.220
Will Game!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:48.130
- Stop it!
- I won't let you kill my sister!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:54.640
That's it!

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:04.530
Mr. Will...

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:07.530
You're not the kind of person who should join Dianna Counter!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.610
Don't do it!

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:13.200
I had to retreat for your sake.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.830
Where did you get that mobile suit?

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.000
Tell me!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.840
If you are from the Dianna Counter...

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.210
I have something I must tell your leader.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.210
Are you from Dianna Counter?

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:26.830
He's part of the Royal Guard, Mr. Will Game.

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:36.520
Use the Kapool to help us move it.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:38.310
That should be fine.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:42.110
Sister, did you really drive down from the top of the valley?

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:45.900
Yes, that's right. I'm here now, right?

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:48.740
What's wrong with Milady Kihel?

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.200
Thank you.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.910
She said she's feeling dizzy after the sudden change in height.

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:54.820
That makes sense.

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:04.420
The Will game I once knew...

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:06.830
You're no longer a part of this world, aren't you?

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:11.420
I'll have to trust Harry to ensure that Will makes the right choice.

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:16.630
Since the Will I knew is still a part of you.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:45.100
<i>Sir Guin once again wishes to begin negotiating with the Moonrace.</i>

00:23:45.100 --> 00:23:48.020
<i>The Militia has gained strength due to its new union.</i>

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:50.950
<i>Mr. Will joins Dianna Counter...</i>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:54.120
<i>...and uses his Mobile Suit to fight against the Militia.</i>

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:56.950
<i>This deeply saddens Miss Kihel.</i>

00:23:57.510 --> 00:24:00.200
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN-A GUNDAM...

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:02.620
Memories Disappear

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:06.540
The wind blows away the dreams of wings.

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>Memories Disappear</b>
